Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.29,0:00:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've really slimmed down, don'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,554.4)}{\an7}French Fry Odyssey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're making great progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup! I've been working my butt off lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So does that mean you're\Nheading home again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure am. I make sure to visit\Nevery once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda's family...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they're like...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:28.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human... I've been killing it\Nwith the weight loss lately, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don'tcha think I deserve a little reward\Nfor all my hard work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess you've got a point...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, you can buy some fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But stick to one small serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.63,0:00:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll spoil your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you, my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.54,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678.4,403.2)}{\an7}Satero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're our location's 10,000th customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And to celebrate, we're gifting you\Na year's supply of free French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.46,0:01:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,A year's supply?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's your stack of coupons!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the King of the Fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's put 'em to use!\NTen orders of fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:19.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,604.8)}{\an7}Potatoes of Shame and the Titan's Fist
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The door was open so we let ourselves in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I was thinking we oughtta\Nswitch up the bodyguard schedule so that-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a surprise.\NWasn't expecting visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.46,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,468)}{\an7}Potatopia
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,J-jeez, did you gain more...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.17,0:01:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, wh-where's the human?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.71,0:01:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where in the hell did these\Nbowling ball bellies come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Knock it off! My clothes are gonna\Nfall apart if you shake me too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.92,0:01:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Ignore them and eat your fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,M'kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom... Munch, munch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:48.75,Q5,,0,0,0,,Quit gorging yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom... Munch, munch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom... Munch, munch...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's faint, but there are\Ntraces of magic on those fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.75,0:01:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no... The satyr?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But we haven't seen her\Nsince the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.75,0:02:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, I can't think of anyone else\Nwho'd do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.79,0:02:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tricking you is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but manipulating the human\Nis no small feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did anything weird happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, not unless you count winning\Na year's supply of free French fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That doesn't strike you as weird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a magic spell known as a "charm."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It messes with your head\Nand impairs your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Probably explains why you and\Nthe elf stuffed your faces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,without noticing anything was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No wonder I felt like the fries\Nwere tastier than normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.33,0:02:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, she also charmed Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That fat tub of lard has a resistance\Nto magic, so not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This was just her usual\Ngreed for French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Staaaaare...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil. We got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:53.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hadn't counted on the elf\Nbeing immune to my sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We meet again, you idiotic elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The burger lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oopsies, I forgot to deactivate my disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The satyr!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.08,0:03:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,All according to plan! You're looking\Nawfully chunky, you nasty elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.42,0:03:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, who're you calling nasty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh please, I know you haven't forgotten\Nwhat you did to humiliate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You stripped me naked and stood by\Nwhile that man leered at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:26.96,Q5,,0,0,0,,I did absolutely nothing of the sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I vowed to get my revenge\Nfor your despicable behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.13,Q5,,0,0,0,,I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I vowed to get my revenge\Nfor your despicable behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:29.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,I would never!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I vowed to get my revenge\Nfor your despicable behavior!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:31.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! How am I supposed to\Ndefend myself against that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if you were the only one given fries,\Nthe human would've put a stop to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the reason you\Nfattened up the human too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You catch on quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great, you got your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not waste mana on\Na pointless fight, so please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,My plot for revenge doesn't stop at\Nfattening the two of them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it goes much deeper than that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's attempting to feed off\Nthe human's avarice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not happening! Ya snooze, ya lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,...and it comes to fruition as soon as\Nthe elf races to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I call it "Operation Bloat Her Belly\Nand Tear Her Clothes to Shreds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,When She Moves Too Fast!\NPlus a Nip Slip!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now you're going to suffer\Nthe same humiliation I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that was my goal all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'see, isn't it embarrassing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,A man gawking at your birthday suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,How does it feel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eh, it doesn't really bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he manhandles me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, wh-what...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.33,0:04:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You m-m-manhandle each other\Nwhile naked on a regular basis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She meant a massage! A massage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:48.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm out of my depth...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen, it wasn't-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless... I'm doomed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you let me talk for a second?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not much of a conclusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kinda underwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Had I known, I would've taken a shift\Nat the corner store instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like WE won! Right, human?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Please cover yourself up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, no need to be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would you smack me\Non the shoulder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how your clothes fell apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe she finally learned her lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great. Now get dressed, wouldja?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:35.04,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.04,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,360)}{\an7}Hours of Operation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oink...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, this sucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to stay hydrated, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.63,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.6,424.8)}{\an7}Star Spud
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh, didn't know the boss owns a gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She opened the place up\Nabout six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,An overachiever, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why a boxing gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Young men glistening with sweat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,as they pour their hearts and souls\Ninto their physical fitness...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their tight, succulent bodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who wouldn't wanna see that up close?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...is what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your boss sure is something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm grateful that she lets me\Nuse it on days when it's normally closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.21,0:06:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how I got into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might be a good opportunity for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.13,0:06:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Opportunity...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was thinking I'd have you ladies\Ngive some different sports a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Having fun while staying active\Nis always a plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's easier to turn exercising\Ninto a habit if we enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, how about we do\Nsome light sparring next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sparring?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.42,0:06:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Incorrect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a form of training where you\Ndon't actually hit your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're bound to have an accident if we\Npit two beginners against each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you'll be facing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll aim to rotate out every two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Kay, Elfuda. You're up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alrighty, the clock's a-tickin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember your combos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eyes on your opponent,\Nand stay light on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never, ever let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This stuff takes a lot of energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought two minutes would be\Na breeze, but this sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.17,0:07:39.58,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,72)}{\an7}Rumble\N{\pos(128,129.6)}{\an7}Rumble
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... it's my turn now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, no pummeling the human!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll knock his head clean off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-Oga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't do it... I'm too afraid\Nof getting punched!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.50,0:08:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?\NThen somebody else spar with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope, no siree! I don't want my face\Nrearranged into modern art!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sparring is off the table!\NYou're a liability!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm used to being a big old misfit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Oga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the difference in strength and size...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where are all the trainers...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.29,0:08:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's even bigger than Oga...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um, the gym's technically closed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's closed? Oh shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess I got the schedule mixed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's kinda embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The people behind you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! Th-that's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-we're in the middle of inventing\Na brand new sport called "costume boxing"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down, human.\NThere's no need for us to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look closely at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:54.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of all the places to run into an elf...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Color me surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,A cyclops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's got... one eye?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Indeed. They're a race of one-eyed giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys like boxing too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, we're takin' a stab at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,How long have you been\Nboxing, Miss Cyclops?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,About a month or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I've never sparred with anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,on account of being really big\Nand scaring people away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's because you giant types\Nare uncannily strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name's Naoe. And you are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hitome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, Hitome, you don't have\Nan opponent to spar with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, would you consider\Nsparring with our friend Oga here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have a similar build,\Nso I think it'd be a perfect match!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Better quit while you're ahead, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.63,0:09:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ogres are giants too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The giant races like fightin' for dominance\Nand they hate losin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's in their blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our folklore contains many gruesome tales\Nborn of their competitive nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but it might be too late to stop them...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-remember, ladies!\NIt's LIGHT sparring!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That means no actual contact, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sundome style.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.63,0:10:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weak sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I told them not to hit each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's no use.\NThey're not listening to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let it go, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They won't stop until they're satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Enjoying a sport while also staying active."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're doing what you\Ntold them to do, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't what I had in mind...
